From: Project Luma <project-luma@local>
Subject: [PATCH] simple: add regional touch focus and exposure metering

The Simple software ISP only exposes a global histogram and a fixed centre
sharpness sample. Add an inexpensive 3x3 metering grid, teach AF and AE to
select a requested cell while retaining the global highlight guard, and
expose normalized focus-point properties from libcamerasrc. This lets
language bindings that cannot construct nested GstValueArray rectangles
still submit standard AfWindows and AfMetering controls.
